<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the first day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Port-of-Spain: Leeward Islands 208 all out (K.Arthurton 70). Trinidad and Tobago 72-5.</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada: Windward Islands 320-5 (J.Murray 186 not out, B.Watt 50) v Guyana.</p>
<p>In Bridgetown: Barbados 256-9 (F.Reifer 59) v Jamaica.</p>
</text>
